40. AGENT CATALOG IS NOT A MARKETPLACE
======================================

Initially implement:

built-in catalog
organization catalog

Do not create payment/revenue marketplace yet.

================================================================
41. COMMUNITY AGENT IMPORT
==========================

If agent definitions can be imported:

treat as untrusted configuration.

Validate:

tools
network
prompts
MCP
skills

Never auto-grant secrets.

================================================================
42. AGENT PROFILE VERSIONING
============================

Running jobs retain profile version.

Changes must not silently mutate active executions.

================================================================
43. MODEL RECOMMENDATIONS
=========================

Recommend suitable models/providers based on capabilities.

Do not use marketing ranking.

Store:

why recommended
requirements matched
cost class
known limitations

================================================================
44. ROUTING FEEDBACK
====================

Collect privacy-safe outcome metadata:

task type
runtime
model
validation result
latency
cost class

Use to improve future recommendation.

Do not store hidden chain-of-thought.

================================================================
45. LOCAL RECOMMENDER
=====================

Recommendation logic should work deterministically without an LLM.

Start rule-based/statistical.

Do not require another paid AI call to choose which AI model to use.

================================================================
46. USAGE FORECASTING
=====================

Build simple local forecast.

Inputs:

historical usage
job count
runtime distribution

Output:

projected usage
confidence/assumptions

Clearly label forecast.

Do not pretend estimate is invoice.

================================================================
47. ZERO-COST FORECAST
======================

Show:

current paid usage
avoidable paid usage
local/free-capable jobs
potential savings

Do not claim exact savings without model price evidence.

================================================================
48. BUDGET RECOMMENDATION
=========================

Recommend limits based on historical data.

Recommendations never automatically change quota.

Require operator confirmation.

================================================================
49. BILLING REMAINS OPTIONAL
============================

FakeBillingProvider remains sufficient for:

local
self-hosted
development

Stripe adapter remains optional.

No-cost release gate must not require:

STRIPE_SECRET_KEY

