97. LOCAL-FIRST E2E
===================

Mandatory test:

fresh install
→ no paid credentials
→ local-free profile
→ create organization/project
→ configure Fake/Local model runtime
→ create workflow
→ execute job
→ validation
→ artifact
→ usage ledger
→ notification
→ dashboard/API result

No external network.

================================================================
98. ZERO-BUDGET E2E
===================

Configure:

max_paid_cost = 0

Attempt job with:

local provider available
→ succeeds

Then disable local provider.

Attempt again
→ rejected before paid call.

Prove no external paid transport invocation occurred.

================================================================
99. WORKFLOW E2E
================

Template:

Fix failing tests

Run via FakeRuntime/local provider.

Verify:

plan
execution
validation
artifact
notification
usage metrics

