114. REQUIRED FINAL TESTS
=========================

Run:

python -m pytest -q -ra
python main.py --version
python -m build

minimal install smoke
full install smoke

local-free E2E
offline E2E
zero-budget E2E
workflow E2E
notification E2E
analytics E2E
cost optimizer tests

Run release gate.

No paid credentials should exist in the environment for no-cost tests.

================================================================
115. DEFINITION OF DONE
=======================

Upgrade-13 is complete only when:

[ ] fresh installation starts without commercial credentials
[ ] local-free profile exists
[ ] offline core works
[ ] SQLite/local storage works
[ ] local artifact store works
[ ] in-app notifications work
[ ] local analytics works
[ ] local/BYO provider architecture exists
[ ] paid fallback is disabled by default in zero-cost mode
[ ] max paid cost = 0 is correctly enforced
[ ] unknown price cannot be classified as free
[ ] billing provider remains optional
[ ] Stripe missing does not break startup
[ ] email provider missing does not break startup
[ ] hosted telemetry missing does not break startup
[ ] workflow domain exists
[ ] workflow versions are durable
[ ] built-in templates work
[ ] agent catalog exists
[ ] imported agents/workflows cannot escalate permissions
[ ] cost optimizer works without an LLM
[ ] usage forecasting works locally
[ ] team activity/notifications require no external provider
[ ] Web/API/SDK work against localhost
[ ] no-cost onboarding requires no payment
[ ] zero-cost E2E makes zero paid transport calls
[ ] documentation starts with no-cost path
[ ] inherited tenant/security tests remain green
[ ] release gate accurately reports paid integrations as optional

================================================================
116. FINAL REPORT FORMAT
